# Environment Variables Template

This file serves as a template for environment configuration. Copy this file to `.env` in each service directory and fill in the actual values.

## General

```env
# Application Environment
NODE_ENV=development
PYTHON_ENV=development

# Application Version
APP_VERSION=2.0.0

# Application Timezone
TZ=UTC
```

## Backend (FastAPI)

```env
# Backend Server
BACKEND_HOST=localhost
BACKEND_PORT=8000
BACKEND_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/pronaflow
DATABASE_POOL_SIZE=20
DATABASE_POOL_TIMEOUT=30

# Redis Cache
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
REDIS_TTL=3600

# JWT Security
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-change-in-production
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRATION_HOURS=24
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRATION_DAYS=7

# CORS
CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:5173","http://localhost:3000","http://localhost:8080"]

# Email
SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USERNAME=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password
FROM_EMAIL=noreply@pronaflow.com

# AWS S3 (if using for file storage)
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-access-key
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-secret-key
AWS_S3_BUCKET=pronaflow-uploads
AWS_REGION=us-east-1

# AI Service
AI_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8001
AI_SERVICE_API_KEY=your-ai-service-key

# Third-party APIs
GITHUB_API_TOKEN=your-github-token
JIRA_API_TOKEN=your-jira-token
SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=your-slack-token
```

## Frontend (React)

```env
# Frontend
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
VITE_APP_NAME=PronaFlow
VITE_APP_VERSION=2.0.0
VITE_LOG_LEVEL=info

# Authentication
VITE_JWT_STORAGE_KEY=auth_token
VITE_SESSION_TIMEOUT_MINUTES=60

# Analytics
VITE_ANALYTICS_ENABLED=false
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=

# Feature Flags
VITE_FEATURE_WEBHOOKS=true
VITE_FEATURE_PLUGINS=true
VITE_FEATURE_BILLING=true
VITE_FEATURE_ADVANCED_ANALYTICS=false
```

## AI Service

```env
# AI Service Server
AI_HOST=localhost
AI_PORT=8001
AI_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Model Configuration
MODEL_PATH=/app/models
MODEL_VERSION=latest

# GPU Support
USE_GPU=false
GPU_MEMORY_FRACTION=0.7

# Inference Settings
BATCH_SIZE=32
MAX_INFERENCE_TIME=30

# Redis
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/1
CACHE_PREDICTIONS=true
CACHE_TTL=3600
```

## Electron (Desktop)

```env
# Electron
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
VITE_APP_VERSION=2.0.0
VITE_APP_NAME=PronaFlow

# Auto-update
AUTO_UPDATE_ENABLED=false
AUTO_UPDATE_URL=https://releases.pronaflow.com

# Logging
ELECTRON_LOG_LEVEL=info
```

## Docker & Deployment

```env
# Docker Registry
DOCKER_REGISTRY=docker.io
DOCKER_USERNAME=your-docker-username
DOCKER_PASSWORD=your-docker-password

# Kubernetes
K8S_NAMESPACE=pronaflow
K8S_REPLICAS=3

# SSL/TLS
SSL_CERT_PATH=/etc/ssl/certs/certificate.crt
SSL_KEY_PATH=/etc/ssl/private/key.key

# Let's Encrypt (if using)
LETS_ENCRYPT_EMAIL=admin@pronaflow.com
LETS_ENCRYPT_DOMAIN=pronaflow.com
```

## Notes

- Never commit `.env` files or actual secrets to git
- Use `.env.local` for local development overrides
- For production, use proper secrets management (HashiCorp Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, etc.)
- Change all `your-*` values with actual credentials
- Use strong, random values for all secret keys
- Rotate credentials regularly
